          "book": "ZEC",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "“In that day there will be a fountain opened to David’s house and to the inhabitants of Jerusalem, for sin and for uncleanness.",
      "ko": "그 날에 죄와 더러움을 씻는 샘이 다윗의 족속과 예루살렘 거민을 위하여 열리리라",
      "source_text_hash": "c121550648c3f652df49d5193f393bd8bed416c672e33adc2382fc111e9ecd37",
      "translation_text_hash": "dea66f9774f4884f07cc13bc088248a5ee45311c451973a28c83bee7269a26ea",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 날에 죄와 더러움을 씻는 샘이 다윗의 족속과 예루살렘 거민을 위하여 열리리라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "dea66f9774f4884f07cc13bc088248a5ee45311c451973a28c83bee7269a26ea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ZEC:13:2",
      "sequence": 23062,
      "chapter_label": "ZEC 13",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
